<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings rise in week to March 11.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings rise in week to March 11.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britan's Sullom Voe terminal rose to to 927,651 tonnes in the week to March 11, compared with 492,974 the previous week,</p>
<p>Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
